    <s:String x:Key="Str.DrsVSync">Vertical sync</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Str.TipVSync">Competitive play favours forcing it off (low latency); on a G-Sync monitor you can cap frames in game instead. Triple buffering has no separate entry under D3D, so turning VSync off is enough</s:String>
