    <s:String x:Key="Str.TipShaderCache">Enabling it reduces compile-time stutter (recommended)</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Str.OnRecommended">On (recommended)</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Str.DrsNote2">Note: written to a driver profile; no game files are changed. Original values are backed up before applying, and Restore default brings them back in one click (together with the DLSS override). Low latency means maximum prerendered frames = 1, roughly the queue semantics of the driver's low latency mode On. If the game offers NVIDIA Reflex, enable Reflex in game and leave prerendering at Application-controlled.</s:String>
